```
The test file remains unchanged and still passes. The anonymous squaring function is still called.
```r
> as.data.frame(file_coverage("covr_test.R", "covr_test_file.R"))
Test passed 😀
     filename     functions first_line first_byte last_line last_byte first_column last_column first_parsed last_parsed value
